## 📋 Requisiti di Sistema

* [.NET 8.0 SDK](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/8.0) (o superiore, supportato tramite roll-forward).
* **OS Supportati**: macOS (Apple Silicon / Intel), Windows 10/11 (x64/ARM64), Linux (glibc).

